 and covered costs for each route.",{"children":"These routes are not interchangeable. A university offer does not automatically create a DSU award, a MAECI application does not replace admission, and a tuition waiver may leave accommodation and living costs unpaid. Compare the application owner, deadline and covered costs for each route."}]],"$undefined","$L2a","$undefined"]}],"$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30"]]}]
